 period. You will not be able to buy tickets or receive promotional marketing while the break is active.","cta":"Take a break","href":"/user/safer-playing"}},"close_continue_to_review":"Continue to account review","close_review_heading":"Review your account","close_review_desc":"Check what happens to your wallet balance and active entries before closing your account.","close_review_error":"We couldn\'t load your account details. Please try again.","close_retry":"Try again","close_cash_heading":"Cash balance","close_cash_desc":"Your cash balance stays on your account. You can withdraw it now if you\'d like to use it before closing.","close_withdraw_now":"Withdraw cash now","close_credit_heading":"Site Credit","close_credit_desc":"Your Site Credit stays on your account, but cannot be used while your account is closed.","close_pending_heading":"Pending payments","close_pending_desc":"Closing your account will not cancel these payments. We may contact you if we need more information to complete them.","close_pending_none":"You have no pending payments.","close_entries_heading":"Active competition entries","close_entries_desc":"Your paid entries remain valid after your account is closed. You will not be able to buy new entries. If you win, we will contact you using your verified contact details.","close_entries_none":"You have no active entries.","close_entries_count":"%d entries","close_entry_draws":"Draws:","close_view_numbers":"View ticket numbers","close_hide_numbers":"Hide ticket numbers","close_entries_more":"View all %d entries","close_contact_heading":"Winner contact details","close_contact_desc":"We will use these details to contact you about any existing entries after your account is closed.","close_contact_warning":"You still have active entries, but we don\'t have valid contact details for you. If you win, we may not be able to reach you. Please update your contact details before closing.","close_email_label":"Email","close_phone_label":"Phone","close_update_